# Smart Numeric Conversion: pd.to_numeric()
s = pd.Series(["10", "20", "30","Komal"])
s = pd.to_numeric(s,errors="coerce")
print(s)
# - 'raise' (Default): Crash if invalid parsing occurs.
# - 'coerce': If it encounters a value it can't convert (like "apple"), it turns it into NaN (Missing Data) and converts the rest of the column to floats!
# - 'ignore': Returns the original input if it fails.


